# Export suite (plan wb079-unified-77f68967, Task 12 / C4+C6).
# production_core_host.cpp compiles the actual production core TU once with WB_UNIFIED_HOST_TEST (the engine
# boundaries route through host::Seam(); the registry, the queues, the pump dispatch, the project membership,
# the C4 copy-envelope provenance, the authoritative value builder (ValueDocumentLocked) and the C6 export
# prepare/write path - publication guard, before-write revalidation, protected replacement - stay production
# code). The shipped proj_codec.cpp/wb_group_math.cpp are linked as their own TUs (the same ones build.bat
# compiles) and the fixture drives real files inside its own directory (host::SetModDir). The real input.cpp and
# Win32 backend are linked (INPUT); only the service boundaries CORE does not link (thumbgen, httpapi, overlay
# textures, MinHook) are explicit host substitutes in production_core_host.cpp. The only substituted export
# boundaries are the one-shot file faults, the deterministic pre-replace callback and the protected-region probe.
@include tools/imgui
@include tools/imgui/backends
@include tools/minhook/include
@define WB_UNIFIED_HOST_TEST
@define _CRT_SECURE_NO_WARNINGS
